@FormsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5150
@formId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List forms (paginated, optionally filtered by subject)
GET {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

###

### List forms filtered by subject
GET {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms?page=1&pageSize=20&subjectFilter=Test
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new form
POST {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Test Subject",
  "description": "Test Description",
  "dueDate": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "priority": 5,
  "critical": false,
  "createdBy": "TestUser"
}

###

### Get a form by ID (replace @formId with an ID returned from Create)
GET {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms/{{formId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update an existing form (replace @formId with an ID returned from Create)
PUT {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms/{{formId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Updated Subject",
  "description": "Updated Description",
  "dueDate": "2027-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "priority": 8,
  "critical": true
}

###

### Soft delete a form (replace @formId with an ID returned from Create)
DELETE {{FormsApi_HostAddress}}/api/forms/{{formId}}

###
